2024-09-23T15:48:38Z","updated_at":"2024-09-23T15:48:38Z","body":"> It would mean the docs would say `/notfound` instead of `$HOME` though, right?\r\n\r\nI hope not.. 🙂 My suggestion was just that it should avoid the gendocs command creating the actual config directory (during config init), but that `$HOME` would still be written to docs. Haven't thought it through, so I may be wrong..","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/2368695359/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"albertony","id":12441419,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDQxNDE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12441419?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony","html_url":"https://github.com/albertony","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertony/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/2368799044","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/8092#issuecomment-2368799044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/8092","id":2368799044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAQ-n5M6NMQFE","user":{"login":"dmcardle","id":183652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzY1Mg==","avatar_url":"https://